## Known warnings

Real-runtime tests still print known warnings:

```text
ExperimentalWarning: Importing JSON modules is an experimental feature and might change at any time
[node-llama-cpp] load: control-looking token: 128247 '</s>' was not control-type; this is probably a bug in the model. its type will be overridden
```

These warnings were already observed in prior Runtime Dev real-runtime tests and did not fail the smoke suites.

## Artifact verification correction

During this branch, stale generated artifacts were accidentally reported as refreshed. This was corrected by adding a stronger verification step:

```text
- rebuild artifact directory from scratch;
- unzip staged files ZIP into a clean source tree;
- verify forbidden old text is absent;
- verify required new text/modes are present;
- run smoke test from the reconstituted artifact tree;
- run artifact_guard against the full candidate tree with content checks.
```

Future artifact handoff should always verify the actual downloadable ZIP, not just the working candidate tree.

