## Caveats

```text
- Real-runtime context creation timing cannot directly inspect native createContext internals.
- Deterministic mock tests provide the exact createSignal proof.
- Real-runtime tests provide local model safety/completion coverage.
- If a future node-llama-cpp version changes createSignal behavior, this branch should be revalidated.
```

